tml","value":"Le meilleur de l'humain et de l'IA, concrètement&nbsp;?"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"e-heading","editor_settings":{"title":"Question 3 · titre"},"version":"0.0"},{"id":"27b8145","elType":"widget","settings":{"classes":{"$$type":"classes","value":["g-1a3f1cd"]},"paragraph":{"$$type":"escaped-html","value":"Nos IA accélèrent tout ce qui peut l'être&nbsp;: pistes créatives, voix off, sous-titres, traductions, déclinaisons. Nos créas gardent la direction artistique, l'animation à la main et la validation finale. C'est ce qui permet l'illimité, sans rien lâcher sur la qualité."}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"e-paragraph","editor_settings":{"title":"Question 3 · réponse"},"version":"0.0"}],"isInner":false,"editor_settings":{"title":"Question 3"},"version":"0.0"},{"id":"7e815bfb","elType":"e-flexbox","settings":{"classes":{"$$type":"classes","value":["g-d9b9258","g-f3c7ac1"]}},"elements":[{"id":"19bc8f83","elType":"widget","settings":{"classes":{"$$type":"classes","value":["g-8780a1c"]},"tag":{"$$type":"string","value":"h3"},"title":{"$$type":"escaped-html","value":"Et nos nouveaux projets&nbsp;?"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"e-heading","editor_settings":{"title":"Question 4 · titre"},"version":"0.0"},{"id":"3e02bb71","elType":"widget","settings":{"classes":{"$$type":"classes","value":["g-1a3f1cd"]},"paragraph":{"$$type":"escaped-html","value":"Bien sûr. Lancements, événements, campagnes&nbsp;: tout nouveau projet entre dans le même flux, avec la même équipe et la même charte."}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"e-paragraph","editor_settings":{"title":"Question 4 · réponse"},"version":"0.0"}],"isInner":false,"editor_settings":{"title":"Question 4"},"version":"0.0"},{"id":"16ee095b","elType":"e-flexbox","settings":{"classes":{"$$type":"classes","value":["g-d9b9258","g-f3c7ac1"]}},"elements":[{"id":"5aaa65e9","elType":"widget","settings":{"classes":{"$$type":"classes","value":["g-8780a1c"]},"tag":{"$$type":"string","value":"h3"},"title":{"$$type":"escaped-html","v